  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-12-01T19:01:45.480Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Would it be possible to have group instances that allow certain roles access to the world, but require for instance the lowest member role to request to join said instance?\n\nFor example - party community wants to get staff into the world and have stream, etc set-up then start allowing guest into the world. They have more members than space in the world so to prevent them flooding the world the instance right when it's created they set it up with only staff levels having access then tell members to request once the world is ready.\n\nAn example in the screenshot would be - create a world with roles that are checked are freely able to join, but the role that is unchecked would be able to request to join.",
